{"4917060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Good Old Cemetery", "steam_appid": 4917060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Who are you? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where are you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is your purpose?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you dead or alive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape. Die. Die. Die again. Escape. You wake up in cemetery. You don't know your own name. Why are you here. The color is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Old cemetery is a roguelike turn based game about trying to escape from cemetery. You wake up in a strange land when humans looks...weird, strange or flat out bizarre. Try to understand, remember, fight against your inevitable death and most of all don't loose your faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is still in it's basic state where three main points are shop, fight and movement. In shop player can buy more health or damage. Fight consists of attack, add damage and run.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the future i want to add more enemies, npcs, events and perfect more ui.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Who are you? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where are you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is your purpose?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you dead or alive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape. Die. Die. Die again. Escape. You wake up in cemetery. You don't know your own name. Why are you here. The color is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Old cemetery is a roguelike turn based game about trying to escape from cemetery. You wake up in a strange land when humans looks...weird, strange or flat out bizarre. Try to understand, remember, fight against your inevitable death and most of all don't loose your faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is still in it's basic state where three main points are shop, fight and movement. In shop player can buy more health or damage. Fight consists of attack, add damage and run.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the future i want to add more enemies, npcs, events and perfect more ui.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Good Old cemetery is a roguelike turn based game about trying to escape from cemetery. You wake up in a strange land when humans looks...weird, strange or flat out bizarre. Try to understand, remember, fight against your inevitable death and most of all don't loose your faith.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917060/8cf8a3ac16ab1bdd872da681aa2438ae1a9c9e0b/header.jpg?t=1787914305", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917060/0623a5ed3ec742e1c297230d34149dcb58f91483/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787914305", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917060/0623a5ed3ec742e1c297230d34149dcb58f91483/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787914305", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2500U<br></li><li><strong>Graphics